{"title": "Night Walker", "pageid": 28430, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Night_Walker", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Night Walker</b> is a passive feature that allows the user freedom of movement without any common restrictions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The affected creature cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enwebbed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\">Enwebbed</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangled</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnared\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnared</a> and cannot slip on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grease\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Grease_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Grease_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grease_(surface)\" title=\"Grease (surface)\">Grease</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disintegrating_Night_Walkers\" title=\"Disintegrating Night Walkers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Disintegrating_Nightwalkers_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Disintegrating_Night_Walkers\" title=\"Disintegrating Night Walkers\">Disintegrating Night Walkers</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Night Walker</b> only provides immunity to Ensnared received from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\">Ensnaring Strike</a> cast up to level two, and not from levels three or higher.\n<ul><li>It additionally does not provide immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Arrow:_Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasping Arrow: Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasping Arrow: Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasping_Arrow:_Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasping Arrow: Entangled (Condition)\">Grasping Arrow: Entangled</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Black Tentacles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Black_Tentacles_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Black Tentacles\">Black Tentacles</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201040\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: fals